wideStreamTest is test
wideStreamTest purpose "A stream made wide keeps its orientation and refuses fputs; fputwc, fwprintf's engine, fgetwc, fgetws, and ungetwc read and write the C locale's bytes; a character past 127 fails with EILSEQ; swprintf keeps every character and refuses what does not fit; swscanf and wscanf's engine read by wide formats"
