wideStreamTest verifies wideWriteFormatted writesWideBytes
wideStreamTest verifies wideStoreFormatted storesWide
wideStreamTest verifies wideScan scansWide
wideStreamTest verifies wideScanText scansWideText
wideStreamTest typeParameter none
